Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is substantial and mixed. It includes official budgets and surveys, IMF/World Bank/ADB assessments, central-bank and audit records, social-protection documentation, academic work, government statements, and Pakistani reporting in English and Urdu. The main source families concern IMF stabilization, fiscal and monetary policy, inflation and poverty, BISP and distribution, public expenditure, SOEs, taxation, energy, procurement, and implementation. Search leads remain unopened candidates; no evidence claims or scores were extracted.

